 "notes": "Right leg, sneakers. TO = most negative point of the pre-swing dip; this leg often shows a broad dip then a sharp later dip, when both are within ~2 deg/s the later one (right before the steep rise) is taken and marked unsure. PO = top of last small bump (>=3 deg/s) before the continuous fall, so some PO are only 80-150 ms before TO. Turnarounds: 113.1-114.3 (small step, MS 114.04 / impact 114.23, no readable PO/TO), 124.95-126.75 (pivot then slow 148 deg/s swing, HS before and after hidden in gaps), 148.3-150.1 (slow 62 deg/s turn swing, TO unreadable), 161.05-162.45 (shank +50 drift with thigh negative, no thigh swing: cannot tell if the leg stepped, all unclear). 129.48-131.45 settling into stand (+-50 deg/s shifts, small taps): unclear. Many Wi-Fi gaps: marks hidden in gaps left out (TO 118.8-119.0, PO 121.34-121.45, MS 154.24-154.35, TO 153.80-153.95, HS 165.04-165.15, TO 167.44-167.55); MS 158.56 placed inside a 60 ms gap from the slopes (unsure); MS 141.90 at the edge of a gap where the rise flattens (unsure). Verification pass (resumed annotator): every mark re-checked on 1-1.5 s zooms; HS = last sample before the big |acc| jump (fixed 120.85, 129.43, 144.18, 146.11, 153.06, 163.61, 168.08); TO 155.37 moved to the deeper broad dip (sharp later dip 3 deg/s shallower), TO 150.95 = sharp dip sample, TO 125.79 = middle of flat bottom; PO 153.69 moved from the hump top to the end of the -55 plateau (fall into TO hidden by the 153.80-153.96 gap); unclear widened to 124.89 (|acc| starts rising before the gap, possible HS) and to 126.66 (impact tail after the gap)."
